WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.630 --> 00:00:03.375
- [Narrator] Okay, so
everybody knows Michelangelo.

00:00:03.375 --> 00:00:06.869
Italian, Renaissance, hipster beard.

00:00:06.869 --> 00:00:08.582
He's made a few things
you might have seen.

00:00:08.582 --> 00:00:09.454
This naked guy,

00:00:09.454 --> 00:00:10.815
this crazy ceiling,

00:00:10.815 --> 00:00:12.360
a couple of paintings.

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:15.305
But did you also know,
that he is the mastermind

00:00:15.305 --> 00:00:18.698
behind one of arts most
innovative inventions,

00:00:18.698 --> 00:00:20.375
Paint by Number?

00:00:20.375 --> 00:00:24.314
(happy, playful music)

00:00:24.314 --> 00:00:27.322
Way back in the 1500s,
Michelangelo was the man,

00:00:27.322 --> 00:00:28.243
top dog,

00:00:28.243 --> 00:00:30.556
he had all the Popes on speed dial.

00:00:30.556 --> 00:00:33.727
He was so busy, he used students
to help him with his work,

00:00:33.727 --> 00:00:36.275
and he started pre-numbering
sections of his paintings

00:00:36.275 --> 00:00:39.670
and ceilings, so that students
could follow the design.

00:00:39.670 --> 00:00:41.178
See where this is headed?

00:00:41.178 --> 00:00:42.669
- [Female Narrator] Ugh.

00:00:42.669 --> 00:00:44.736
- [Narrator] Fast forward to 1949.

00:00:44.736 --> 00:00:47.644
Dan Robbins was an artist
at the Palmer Paint Company

00:00:47.644 --> 00:00:48.601
in Michigan.

00:00:48.601 --> 00:00:50.733
And he had an idea.

00:00:50.733 --> 00:00:52.782
He created painting kits
and pre-numbered them,

00:00:52.782 --> 00:00:54.551
like Michelangelo did,

00:00:54.551 --> 00:00:57.051
and Paint by Numbers was born.

00:00:58.110 --> 00:00:59.972
Pretty soon, it was hugely popular.

00:00:59.972 --> 00:01:02.270
Seriously, everybody was doing it.

00:01:02.270 --> 00:01:03.190
For goodness sakes,

00:01:03.190 --> 00:01:07.333
J. Edgar Hoover has one
hanging in the White House.

00:01:07.333 --> 00:01:09.935
Today, Dan Robbins, with
the help of the rest of us,

00:01:09.935 --> 00:01:13.627
is probably the most
displayed artist in the world.

00:01:13.627 --> 00:01:15.087
Sorry, Michelangelo.

00:01:15.087 --> 00:01:18.586
(playful music)

00:01:18.586 --> 00:01:20.753
- [Michelangelo] Whatever.

